sections.usage:
```
Create a design tokens file in dtcg format for [COMPANY], a [INDUSTRY] company. Include tokens for colors, typography, spacing, and shadows. Use [DATA] as a reference for the design system.
```
Copy

```
```json
{
  "colors": {
    "primary": "#4285F4",
    "secondary": "#34A853",
    "error": "#EA4335",
    "text": "#202124",
    "background": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  "typography": {
    "fontFamily": "Roboto, sans-serif",
    "fontSizes": {
      "small": "12px",
      "medium": "14px",
      "large": "16px"
    },
    "fontWeights": {
      "regular": 400,
      "bold": 700
    }
  },
  "spacing": {
    "small": "8px",
    "medium": "16px",
    "large": "24px"
  },
  "shadows": {
    "small": "0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60, 64, 67, 0.3)",
    "medium": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(60, 64, 67, 0.3)",
    "large": "0 1px 6px 0 rgba(60, 64, 67, 0.3)"
  }
}
```
```

sections.usage_vi:
```
